# See theme/qmldir — a singleton without a qmldir entry is invisible to any
# file outside its own directory.
singleton Config 1.0 Config.qml
singleton Migrations 1.0 Migrations.qml
# The default keybindings, on their own. Split out of Config.qml so the file
# everybody reads is about settings rather than about sixty rows of table.
singleton Binds 1.0 Binds.qml
# Export, import and reset. Separate from Config because they act on the FILE
# rather than on a setting — see the note at the top of Backup.qml.
singleton Backup 1.0 Backup.qml
# Writing to `outputs`, the one setting that is a list of objects and therefore
# cannot be reached by a dotted path. Separate from Config for the same reason
# Backup is: it is a way of writing, not a thing that is written.
singleton Outputs 1.0 Outputs.qml
